# Original PNG downloads from the official site (21 MB).
# The optimised WebP derivatives in public/images/ are committed, so the site
# builds without these. They are only needed to re-run `npm run images`, and
# can be fetched again from the URLs listed in scripts/build-images.mjs.
raw-photos/
